# Desktop with a pattern CONTROL.INI does not list (WIN.INI [Desktop] Pattern=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8, also on
# the desktop) and a wallpaper that does not exist: OK shows message 215 (the settings before the
# wallpaper are written already), then Cancel. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/desktop-nowall.scn
# (reference run with -WinIni 'Desktop/Pattern=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8').
# Run with ARCH311_INI_DIR=<folder with that WIN.INI>:
#   tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/desktop-nowall.w16 OUT Desktop
# The rig's frame of the typed name caught "nofile." half typed (that field is left out). Message 215
# (03-message) checks USER's MessageBox layout (seg42:04F5) with a blank line in the text.
# regress: mkdir -p "$OUT/ini0" && sed 's/^Pattern=(None)/Pattern=1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8/' "$ARCH311_REF/c-pristine/WINDOWS/WIN.INI" > "$OUT/ini0/WIN.INI" && ARCH311_REF_INI=1 ARCH311_INI_DIR="$OUT/ini0" sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" Desktop
# compare: desk-nowall/02.png 01-desktop.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-nowall/03.png 02-typed.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354 ignore 76 258 164 278
# compare: desk-nowall/04.png 03-message.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-nowall/05.png 04-back.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 338 334 350 354
# compare: desk-nowall/06.png 05-closed.png 0 240 640 480 ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: desk-nowall/06.png 05-closed.png 430 0 640 240
# ini: WIN.INI windows CoolSwitch=1
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop Pattern=
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop IconSpacing=75
# ini: WIN.INI Desktop TileWallPaper=1
sleep 600
shot shots/01-desktop.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
type nofile.bmp
sleep 200
shotcaret shots/02-typed.png
key enter
sleep 500
shot shots/03-message.png
key enter
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04-back.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/05-closed.png
quit
